### Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code, then click "Send Request" above each ### line.
### Change the next line to your Render URL later (no slash at the end).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. GET /health  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. GET all  -> 200 and an array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records

### 3. POST valid  -> 201 (the new id is saved automatically)
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Broken classroom light",
  "category": "Electrical",
  "description": "The light in Room B12 does not switch on.",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 4. GET the new record  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{created.response.body.id}}

### 5. PUT the same id  -> 200, same id, new values
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Broken classroom light fixed",
  "category": "Electrical",
  "description": "The light in Room B12 was repaired today.",
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 6. DELETE the same id  -> 200 {"message":"Record deleted."}
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{created.response.body.id}}

### 7. GET it again  -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{created.response.body.id}}

### 8. POST missing title  -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Hardware",
  "description": "No title is sent here.",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 9. POST invalid status  -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad status test",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "description": "This status is not allowed.",
  "status": "Done"
}

### 10. Malformed JSON  -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "broken json",

### 11. Invalid id  -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/abc

### 12. Id that does not exist: GET, PUT, DELETE each  -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/99999

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/records/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Missing record",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "description": "This id does not exist.",
  "status": "Pending"
}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/records/99999

### 13. Unknown route  -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/nothing-here
